I have rarely played an Elf but I had a good one recently. Guaranteed
win, in fact, AC -35, +8 Excal, etc, etc, until I choked on a corpse in
hell.
Once you get down in the dungeon, all classes are much the same, but it's
the early stages where the differences matter. You have to be much more
careful playing Elves. Be prepared to run away more often. Hope for a
decent shop or two.
BTW, getting your XpLvl up rapidly (such as by reverse-genociding) is an
even worse thing to do when playing an Elf, since you are so poorly
equipped to deal with the harder monsters which will start appearing.
Waste no time getting down in the dungeon!

